WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.534
-As the committee investigating

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:05.767
the coup attempt on January 6th
continues to reveal new evidence

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:07.901
of a coordinated criminal plot
by Donald Trump

00:00:07.901 --> 00:00:09.334
to overthrow American democracy,

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:11.400
Trump is responding
by suggesting

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.000
he might pardon
the January 6th defendants,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.701
if he gets reelected in 2024.

00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:17.801
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:21.834
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:21.834 --> 00:00:24.534
The reason these hearings
are important is very simple --

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:27.000
this wasn't a one-off
and Trump hasn't forgotten.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.567
If he gets the chance,
he's going to finish the job.

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:31.968
And this is one
of the rare times

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:33.334
you can say that about Trump.

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:34.934
He's not exactly a closer.

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.367
[ Laughter ]
I'm not sure he ever technically

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.267
finished any of his buildings.

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:40.734
[ Laughter ]
I'm pretty sure that,

00:00:40.734 --> 00:00:42.934
instead of putting fire alarms
in his condos,

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.400
he just painted them on.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:47.000
But Trump has made it
abundantly clear

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.334
that he hasn't forgotten
about the 2020 election

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:50.634
and he hasn't let it go.

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:52.634
If he gets the chance,
he will absolutely finish

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:54.501
the coup he started
on January 6th,

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:57.834
as he made clear recently,
when he dangled the possibility

00:00:57.834 --> 00:01:00.901
of pardoning defendants
in January 6th cases.

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:03.000
-Even while
January 6th defendants

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.367
are having their lives
totally destroyed

00:01:05.367 --> 00:01:08.234
and being treated worse
than terrorists and murderers,

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.968
despite most being charged

00:01:10.968 --> 00:01:14.300
with parading
through the Capitol.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.200
Most people.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.467
Should not be treated
the way they're being treated.

00:01:18.467 --> 00:01:20.400
[ Laughter ]
And, if I become

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:23.367
president someday,
if I decide to do it,

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:27.033
I will be looking at them very,
very seriously for pardons.

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:28.567
Very, very seriously.

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:29.601
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:29.601 --> 00:01:31.400
They've been treated
very unfairly.

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:34.567
Should I decide to do that.

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:36.801
-Trump is so bad at playing coy,

00:01:36.801 --> 00:01:38.667
if he had a fan,
he'd cut a hole in it,

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:40.100
so you can still see his mouth.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:43.667
He says,
"If I decide to do it,"

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:44.968
like he's threatening to streak

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:47.200
across the quad
after a frat party.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.567
[ Laughter ]
[ As Trump ] I dare you guys
to join me.

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:50.334
If I decide to do it.

00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:52.200
[ Laughter ]
"Donald, you're already naked."

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.167
[ As Trump ]
So be it!

00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:54.667
[ Laughter and applause ]
Second,

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:57.868
when you say they were charged
with parading like that,

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:00.167
you make it sound
like they were on floats,

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:03.534
wearing sashes that said,
"Happy Insurrection Day."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:05.701
Yes, there is such a thing
as illegal parading,

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:06.968
or demonstrating in the Capitol,

00:02:06.968 --> 00:02:08.400
and many people have been
charged with that,

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.467
but that's very different
from parading,

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:12.067
in the sense Trump seems
to be using it.

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:14.133
I mean, in New York, we have
parades like every day.

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.067
It's completely different.

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:16.400
Every time I get in a cab
and say,

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.367
I want to go to Midtown,
the cabbie says something like,

00:02:18.367 --> 00:02:20.801
"Well, it's Luxembourgian
Independence Day,

00:02:20.801 --> 00:02:22.968
so I got to take you
through Secaucus."

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:24.734
[ Laughter ]
The other day,

00:02:24.734 --> 00:02:26.400
traffic was stopped
along Fifth Avenue

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.567
because there was a parade
for the

00:02:27.567 --> 00:02:29.734
National Association
of Trombone Players

00:02:29.734 --> 00:02:31.734
[ Laughter ]
Annual Trombone
Appreciation Day.

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:33.968
It was so annoying.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:35.968
Every time someone dropped
their ice cream cone,

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:37.067
you'd hear this --

00:02:37.067 --> 00:02:38.634
[ Sad trombone ]

00:02:38.634 --> 00:02:41.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:45.400
In fact, contrary to Trump,
several members

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.667
of right-wing groups
and militias

00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:49.033
have been charged
with seditious conspiracy.

00:02:49.033 --> 00:02:50.801
In fact, we learned
from the committee last week

00:02:50.801 --> 00:02:54.400
the rioters got within 40 feet
of Vice President Mike Pence

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.400
and were absolutely willing
to do physical harm to Pence,

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.601
if they had the chance.

00:02:58.601 --> 00:03:00.801
-Vice President Pence
and his team,

00:03:00.801 --> 00:03:04.133
ultimately, were led
to a secure location,

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:06.801
where they stayed for the next
four and a half hours...

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:11.100
...barely missing rioters
a few feet away.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.000
-Approximately 40 feet.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.634
That's all there was,

00:03:14.634 --> 00:03:18.234
40 feet between
the vice president and the mob.

00:03:18.234 --> 00:03:19.767
Make no mistake
about the fact

00:03:19.767 --> 00:03:22.601
that the vice president's life
was in danger.

00:03:22.601 --> 00:03:25.834
A recent court filing by the
Department of Justice explains

00:03:25.834 --> 00:03:28.634
that a confidential informant
from the Proud Boys

00:03:28.634 --> 00:03:31.033
told the FBI the Proud Boys

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:34.067
would've killed Mike Pence,
if given a chance.

00:03:34.067 --> 00:03:35.934
-One thing we're learning
from this investigation is

00:03:35.934 --> 00:03:37.434
that the coup
was much more sinister

00:03:37.434 --> 00:03:39.801
than that pic of the dude
jacking the podium.

00:03:39.801 --> 00:03:41.501
[ Laughter ]
If the rioters had the chance,

00:03:41.501 --> 00:03:43.367
they would've done
the same thing to Mike Pence.

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:44.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.534 --> 00:03:45.868
You know, the guy
who took the podium

00:03:45.868 --> 00:03:47.100
probably thought he had Pence.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.934
You were supposed
to grab the VP!

00:03:48.934 --> 00:03:50.868
"This has the same charisma!"

00:03:50.868 --> 00:03:53.801
[ Laughter ]
I feel like, as a nation,

00:03:53.801 --> 00:03:55.901
we haven't all fully appreciated

00:03:55.901 --> 00:03:57.467
the degree
to which the president

00:03:57.467 --> 00:03:59.667
basically almost got
the vice president killed.

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:01.167
That feels like something you
only read about

00:04:01.167 --> 00:04:03.501
in history books,
like the Burr-Hamilton Duel.

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:05.734
Of course,
if Trump and Pence ever dueled,

00:04:05.734 --> 00:04:07.467
only one thing
would be certain --

00:04:07.467 --> 00:04:10.100
Trump ain't doing
the full ten paces.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.167
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:12.334
[ As Pence ]
Now, before we do this,

00:04:12.334 --> 00:04:14.567
Mr. President,
I would like your assurances

00:04:14.567 --> 00:04:16.033
that we are agreed on the rules.

00:04:16.033 --> 00:04:17.701
[ As Trump ]
Absolutely, Mike, ten passes.

00:04:17.701 --> 00:04:19.534
Maybe eight, but at least five.

00:04:19.534 --> 00:04:20.968
[ Laughter ]
With that said --

00:04:20.968 --> 00:04:22.734
With that said, Mike,
I have big paces,

00:04:22.734 --> 00:04:26.534
so three of mine are probably
worth ten of your tiny paces.

00:04:26.534 --> 00:04:30.167
[ Laughter ]
Everyone seems to have moved on

00:04:30.167 --> 00:04:32.934
from the threat to Pence,
and that includes Pence himself,

00:04:32.934 --> 00:04:35.667
who also seems to not be holding
a grudge against Trump

00:04:35.667 --> 00:04:37.300
for, you know,
almost getting him killed.

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:39.634
Just a week ago,
Pence bragged about his record

00:04:39.634 --> 00:04:40.934
in the Trump administration,
tweeting...

00:04:45.434 --> 00:04:48.334
Pence is like that clueless guy
you date in college

00:04:48.334 --> 00:04:50.434
who could not understand
that you were dumping him.

00:04:50.434 --> 00:04:51.801
[ Laughter ]
We should see other people.

00:04:51.801 --> 00:04:53.234
"I see other people
all the time.

00:04:53.234 --> 00:04:55.100
Look, there's one.
Alright, pick you up at 8:00."

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.334
No, dude, we're over.

00:04:56.334 --> 00:04:58.634
"Over the moon about this
perfect relationship."

00:04:58.634 --> 00:04:59.701
[ Laughter ]
I'm breaking up with you.

00:04:59.701 --> 00:05:01.501
"I've been told
I break people up

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:02.534
with my knock-knock jokes."

00:05:02.534 --> 00:05:04.000
[ Laughter ]

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.567
So it's pretty clear
that Trump was,

00:05:05.567 --> 00:05:08.100
at the very least, indifferent
as to whether he had put

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.033
his own vice president
in physical danger

00:05:10.033 --> 00:05:12.801
and it's also clear
Trump sicced the mob on Pence

00:05:12.801 --> 00:05:14.501
for not following through
on something

00:05:14.501 --> 00:05:16.300
even Trump himself
knew was illegal.

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.701
Last week, the committee
provided new evidence

00:05:18.701 --> 00:05:21.334
that Trump and his pro-coup
lawyer, John Eastman,

00:05:21.334 --> 00:05:22.868
who laid out a detailed plan

00:05:22.868 --> 00:05:24.367
for how Pence could overturn
the election,

00:05:24.367 --> 00:05:26.701
knew the plan was
against the law

00:05:26.701 --> 00:05:28.801
when they tried to get Pence
to do it.

00:05:28.801 --> 00:05:31.434
In fact, toward the end
of Trump's presidency,

00:05:31.434 --> 00:05:33.400
Eastman even sent an email
to Rudy Giuliani,

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:36.901
casually suggesting that maybe
Trump should pardon Eastman.

00:05:36.901 --> 00:05:39.133
-Dr. Eastman emailed
Rudy Giuliani

00:05:39.133 --> 00:05:40.868
and requested
that he be included

00:05:40.868 --> 00:05:43.067
on a list
of potential recipients

00:05:43.067 --> 00:05:44.300
of a presidential pardon.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.601
Dr. Eastman's email stated...

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:53.501
I've decided that I should be
on the pardon list

00:05:53.501 --> 00:05:55.501
-He's like a guy walking
up to the bouncer at a club

00:05:55.501 --> 00:05:56.667
by himself, trying to get in.

00:05:56.667 --> 00:05:59.400
"I've decided I should be
on the VIP list."

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.767
[ Laughter ]
[ Italian accent ] Move.
Move out of the way,

00:06:00.767 --> 00:06:02.167
or I'm going to squeeze
your head like a grape.

00:06:02.167 --> 00:06:03.868
Right this way, ladies.

00:06:03.868 --> 00:06:05.300
[ Laughter ]

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.801
Also, I love how he phrased it,

00:06:06.801 --> 00:06:09.868
like he had just sort of
casually thought about a pardon,

00:06:09.868 --> 00:06:11.167
like it was a fun idea,

00:06:11.167 --> 00:06:13.534
and not that it was starting
to dawn on him

00:06:13.534 --> 00:06:15.501
that he was breaking the law
and might go to prison.

00:06:15.501 --> 00:06:18.067
He's like a guy on the phone
with his insurance agent

00:06:18.067 --> 00:06:19.067
while you can hear the sound

00:06:19.067 --> 00:06:20.734
of fire trucks
in the background.

00:06:20.734 --> 00:06:23.434
"Yeah, hey, a few months ago,
you mentioned fire insurance

00:06:23.434 --> 00:06:25.267
[ Laughter ]
and I was thinking about it

00:06:25.267 --> 00:06:28.067
during our fireworks-themed
gender reveal party

00:06:28.067 --> 00:06:29.634
[ Laughter ]
and maybe I should --

00:06:29.634 --> 00:06:31.667
yeah, maybe I should get that.

00:06:31.667 --> 00:06:33.701
[ Laughter ]
And I guess it makes sense

00:06:33.701 --> 00:06:35.100
that, if you're looking
for the pardon list,

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:36.434
you'd email Rudy Giuliani.

00:06:36.434 --> 00:06:38.334
He's definitely the guy

00:06:38.334 --> 00:06:40.501
who came up with the idea
of a pardon list.

00:06:40.501 --> 00:06:43.100
[ Laughter ]
The pardon list is probably
just every possible version

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:46.167
of his own name written on the
back of a steakhouse napkin.

00:06:46.167 --> 00:06:47.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:47.934 --> 00:06:49.834
Because even Rudy,
who we tend to think of

00:06:49.834 --> 00:06:52.167
as a delusional,
bumbling doofus,

00:06:52.167 --> 00:06:53.234
due to, you know...

00:06:53.234 --> 00:06:55.901
[ Laughter ]

00:06:55.901 --> 00:06:57.334
And, yeah, I know we use
that picture a lot,

00:06:57.334 --> 00:06:58.767
but here's the deal --
you keep laughing at it,

00:06:58.767 --> 00:06:59.534
we're going to keep using it.

00:06:59.534 --> 00:07:00.901
[ Laughter ]
Even Rudy

00:07:00.901 --> 00:07:02.834
apparently knew that the whole
scheme was illegal.

00:07:02.834 --> 00:07:05.534
That's according
to a deposition broadcast
by the committee last week

00:07:05.534 --> 00:07:07.567
from former Trump White House
lawyer Eric Herschmann.

00:07:07.567 --> 00:07:11.334
Herschmann said he had told
Eastman that his plan was insane

00:07:11.334 --> 00:07:13.601
and that, later,
Rudy had agreed with Herschmann

00:07:13.601 --> 00:07:14.968
that the plan was illegal.

00:07:14.968 --> 00:07:18.334
-The president's own lead
outside counsel, Rudy Giuliani,

00:07:18.334 --> 00:07:19.767
also seemed to concede

00:07:19.767 --> 00:07:22.067
that the vice president
did not have the authority

00:07:22.067 --> 00:07:24.167
to decide the outcome
of the election

00:07:24.167 --> 00:07:26.534
or send it back to the states.

00:07:26.534 --> 00:07:29.334
Here's what White House attorney
Eric Herschmann said

00:07:29.334 --> 00:07:30.934
about his call
with Mayor Giuliani

00:07:30.934 --> 00:07:32.234
on the morning of the 6th.

00:07:33.567 --> 00:07:35.667
-The morning of January 6th,

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:38.434
he called me
out of the blue, right?

00:07:38.434 --> 00:07:41.033
And I was like getting dressed.

00:07:41.033 --> 00:07:45.100
And we had
an intellectual discussion

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:47.334
about Eastman's --

00:07:47.334 --> 00:07:48.601
I don't know if it's Eastman's
theory per se,

00:07:48.601 --> 00:07:51.133
but the VP's role.

00:07:51.133 --> 00:07:53.033
And,

00:07:53.033 --> 00:07:55.968
you know, he was asking me
my view, analysis,

00:07:55.968 --> 00:07:58.634
and then the practical
implications of it.

00:07:58.634 --> 00:08:02.000
And, when we finished, he said,

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.434
"I believe that, you know,
you're probably right."

00:08:05.434 --> 00:08:06.901
-First of all,
I doubt it was truly

00:08:06.901 --> 00:08:09.133
an intellectual discussion,
if Rudy was involved.

00:08:09.133 --> 00:08:12.234
[ Laughter ]
Saying you had an intellectual
discussion with Rudy Giuliani

00:08:12.234 --> 00:08:14.334
is like saying you played chess
with a horse.

00:08:14.334 --> 00:08:16.133
[ Laughter ]

00:08:16.133 --> 00:08:19.434
Second, it's incredible to me
that even Rudy knew

00:08:19.434 --> 00:08:22.100
it was a crazy and bad idea.
Rudy.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.167
That's how you know your plan is
truly [bleep] insane.

00:08:25.167 --> 00:08:26.667
[ Laughter ]
This is a guy who,

00:08:26.667 --> 00:08:28.467
while under multiple
investigations,

00:08:28.467 --> 00:08:30.267
thought it was a good idea
to do a video

00:08:30.267 --> 00:08:31.968
using an Abraham Lincoln filter.

00:08:31.968 --> 00:08:33.334
[ Laughter ]

00:08:33.334 --> 00:08:38.067
That same guy looked
at John Eastman's plan and said,

00:08:38.067 --> 00:08:40.534
"I...don't know."

00:08:40.534 --> 00:08:42.067
[ Laughter ]

00:08:42.067 --> 00:08:44.434
The January 6th hearings
have revealed a ton

00:08:44.434 --> 00:08:46.801
of incriminating new details,
so far, including the fact

00:08:46.801 --> 00:08:48.634
that the attempted coup was
a lot more sinister

00:08:48.634 --> 00:08:50.667
and a lot more sophisticated
than previously known.

00:08:50.667 --> 00:08:52.601
Even Trump and his cronies
knew it was illegal.

00:08:52.601 --> 00:08:54.434
They clearly
had criminal intent.

00:08:54.434 --> 00:08:56.200
Now, Trump is
basically admitting

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.067
that he'll do it again,
if he gets the opportunity.

00:08:58.067 --> 00:08:59.534
He's confessing in advance.

00:08:59.534 --> 00:09:02.200
It's like he's writing his own
version of that book by O.J.,

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.234
called, "If I Did It,"
except Trump's is called...

00:09:05.234 --> 00:09:06.601
-If I decide to do it.

00:09:06.601 --> 00:09:07.968
[ Laughter ]

00:09:07.968 --> 00:09:09.133
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:09:09.133 --> 00:09:12.801
♪♪

00:09:12.801 --> 00:09:14.434
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

